      "match_notes": "<p>Note&nbsp;from&nbsp;John&nbsp;Stevens&nbsp;of&nbsp;Greenmount&nbsp;CC</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Greenmount&nbsp;made&nbsp;74&nbsp;from&nbsp;just&nbsp;5&nbsp;overs&nbsp;before&nbsp;rain&nbsp;interrupted&nbsp;play.&nbsp;I&rsquo;d&nbsp;say&nbsp;they&nbsp;were&nbsp;off&nbsp;for&nbsp;45&nbsp;mins&nbsp;approx&nbsp;after&nbsp;which&nbsp;the&nbsp;umpires&nbsp;/&nbsp;scorers&nbsp;agreed&nbsp;a&nbsp;further&nbsp;adjusted&nbsp;DLS&nbsp;target&nbsp;-&nbsp;which&nbsp;had&nbsp;already&nbsp;been&nbsp;achieved.&nbsp;They&nbsp;brought&nbsp;the&nbsp;teams&nbsp;back&nbsp;for&nbsp;one&nbsp;ball&nbsp;and&nbsp;declared&nbsp;the&nbsp;Greenmount&nbsp;win.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">However&nbsp;the&nbsp;key&nbsp;point&nbsp;is&nbsp;that&nbsp;Great&nbsp;Harwood&nbsp;were&nbsp;bowled&nbsp;out&nbsp;in&nbsp;29&nbsp;overs&nbsp;and&nbsp;Greenmount&nbsp;had&nbsp;already&nbsp;achieved&nbsp;the&nbsp;DLS&nbsp;adjusted&nbsp;target&nbsp;once&nbsp;play&nbsp;resumed&nbsp;after&nbsp;the&nbsp;break.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Great&nbsp;Harwood&nbsp;CC&nbsp;1st&nbsp;XI&nbsp;Innings</strong><br />\r\n15.4&nbsp;Great&nbsp;Harwood&nbsp;CC&nbsp;1st&nbsp;XI:&nbsp;50&nbsp;runs&nbsp;in&nbsp;15.4&nbsp;overs,&nbsp;71&nbsp;minutes,&nbsp;5&nbsp;extras<br />\r\n28.2&nbsp;Great&nbsp;Harwood&nbsp;CC&nbsp;1st&nbsp;XI:&nbsp;100&nbsp;runs&nbsp;in&nbsp;28.2&nbsp;overs,&nbsp;117&nbsp;minutes,&nbsp;7&nbsp;extras<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Greenmount&nbsp;CC&nbsp;1st&nbsp;XI&nbsp;Innings</strong><br />\r\n3.3&nbsp;1st&nbsp;Wicket:&nbsp;50&nbsp;runs&nbsp;in&nbsp;21&nbsp;balls,&nbsp;18&nbsp;minutes,&nbsp;Jacques&nbsp;Snyman&nbsp;18&nbsp;(10),&nbsp;Tom&nbsp;Heaton&nbsp;25&nbsp;(11),&nbsp;11&nbsp;extras<br />\r\n3.3&nbsp;Greenmount&nbsp;CC&nbsp;1st&nbsp;XI:&nbsp;50&nbsp;runs&nbsp;in&nbsp;3.2&nbsp;overs,&nbsp;18&nbsp;minutes,&nbsp;11&nbsp;extras</p>\r\n"